{
  name: "item-liquid-teleport",
  displayName: "Item Liquid Teleport",
  author: "namds666 & Claude Code & Codex",
  subtitle: "v1.4.6: Outpost drones mine anywhere inside their range",
  description: "Adds cheat-grade Chrono blocks for global item and liquid transport, terrain conversion, item conversion, repair, construction, overdrive, unit buffs, unit debuffs, and core placement, plus the Outpost drone mining base.
  Update: Outpost drones now stay in place anywhere inside their mine range and fly closer only when they are farther than the range, so drones no longer push each other for one spot.
  Update: every Outpost carry capacity upgrade line is cut to one quarter; Quad Outpost helper drones now scale their carry capacity with the capacity level of their parent drone.
  Update: Quad Outpost helper drones stay linked to their parent drone after a save loads and no longer die when you enter a world.
  Update: new Mine range upgrade line makes the drone mining beam longer on every Outpost; Quad Outpost helper drones now move at the same speed as their parent drone.
  Update: Outpost mine tier upgrades never cost items above the tier they unlock; on Erekir every Outpost upgrade uses Erekir items.
  Update: Mega and Quad Outposts get their own building design with hangar pads, struts, and a central reactor.
  Update: four Small Outposts in a 2x2 square merge into a Mega Outpost (4x4) and four Outposts merge into a Quad Outpost (6x6); both build heavy drones with four times the stats and an upgrade ladder that reaches sixteen times; Quad drones deploy Mono helpers.
  Update: the Outpost ore picker unlocks ores right after a mine tier upgrade; a new Lowest button makes the Outpost mine the minable ore the core has the least of.
  Update: with Auto Steal on, the unloaders link only buildings of other teams, including derelict; own-team buildings are skipped. Turning Auto Steal on drops own-team links; turning it off drops other-team links.
  Update: auto link now links only sources that output the selected item; the category check runs before the item filter to reduce lag; every item and liquid picker uses an 8x2 grid on a dark underlay.
  Update: every block, unit, status, and menu string is translated into all 35 languages Mindustry supports; a check blocks commits that miss a translation.
  Update: new Small Outpost, a 2x2 mono-based Outpost with lower upgrade limits; ore selector shows one row per planet; upgrade cost colors update live.
  Update: new Outpost block builds flying mining drones that deliver a selected ore to the core; upgrade unit cap, speed, mine speed, carry capacity, and mine tier with items from the core.",
  version: "1.4.6",
  minGameVersion: "146"
}
